<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Soundview ups Adaptec on EPS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Soundview ups Adaptec on EPS.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview semiconductor analyst Scott Randall increased his earnings estimates slightly on Adaptec Inc to $1.66 per share from $1.65 for fiscal 1997 and to $2.05 from $2.03 from fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- He left his ratings unchanged on the company at short-term buy and long-term hold.</p>
</text>
